I'm a tinkerer who loves all things computer and math. I mainly mess around with [Zig](https://ziglang.org/) and C in my free time. 
Highly interested in systems programming, embedded systems and firmware development.

I'm also obsessed with keyboard-centric workflow (I personally use an ergonomic column-staggered split keyboard). 
And naturally I also prefer a keyboard-focused editor like [neovim](https://neovim.io/) (although, [helix](https://helix-editor.com/) is looking really nice these days).

I love music! I listen to all kinds of music from math rock, midwest emo to big room house, DnB and hardstyle. I also produce music sometimes.

